      <button class="spec-tab-btn px-4 py-2 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold tracking-tight transition-all bg-neutral-100 text-neutral-600 hover:bg-neutral-200 hover:text-zinc-950" data-target="dryers">
        Industrial Dryers (15 - 100 KG)
