      <button class="spec-tab-btn px-4 py-2 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold tracking-tight transition-all bg-neutral-100 text-neutral-600 hover:bg-neutral-200 hover:text-zinc-950" data-target="stackers">
        LG Stacker Towers (10 &bull; 15 KG)
